==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|belly|ache}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈbɛliˌeɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-bellyache.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any [[pain]] in the [[belly]], [[stomach]], or [[abdomen]].
#: ''Eating too much candy can give you a '''bellyache'''.''

